       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       AUTHOR. LEGACY-SYSTEMS-TEAM.
       
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO 'EMPFILE.DAT'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
           SELECT PAYROLL-REPORT ASSIGN TO 'PAYREP.OUT'
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  EMPLOYEE-FILE.
       01  EMP-RECORD.
           05  EMP-ID              PIC X(06).
           05  EMP-NAME            PIC X(25).
           05  EMP-DEPT            PIC X(04).
           05  EMP-SALARY-RAW      PIC 9(07)V99.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FLAGS.
           05  WS-EOF              PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05  WS-STATUS           PIC 9(02) VALUE ZEROES.
       01  WS-CALCULATION-DATA.
           05  WS-GROSS-PAY        PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE ZEROES.
           05  WS-TAX-RATE         PIC V999     VALUE .220.
           05  WS-TAX-DUE          PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE ZEROES.
           05  WS-NET-PAY          PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE ZEROES.
       01  WS-DEDUCTIONS-REDEFINED.
           05  WS-DED-PACKED       PIC X(08).
           05  WS-DED-NUMERIC REDEFINES WS-DED-PACKED PIC 9(06)V99.
       01  WS-BENEFITS-TABLE.
           05  WS-BENEFIT-ITEM OCCURS 5 TIMES.
               10  BENEFIT-CODE    PIC X(03).
               10  BENEFIT-AMT     PIC 9(05)V99.

           COPY EMPREC.CPY.

           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1100-INIT-ENVIRONMENT.
           PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-PAYROLL THRU 2000-EXIT
               UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'.
           PERFORM 3000-SUMMARY-REPORT.
           PERFORM 4000-TERMINATE-PROGRAM.
           STOP RUN.

       1100-INIT-ENVIRONMENT.
           OPEN INPUT EMPLOYEE-FILE
                OUTPUT PAYROLL-REPORT.
           PERFORM 1200-READ-NEXT-EMP.

       1200-READ-NEXT-EMP.
           READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
               AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
           END-READ.

       2000-PROCESS-PAYROLL.
           MOVE EMP-SALARY-RAW TO WS-GROSS-PAY.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT TAX_PERCENT INTO :WS-TAX-RATE
               FROM TAX_RATES
               WHERE DEPT_ID = :EMP-DEPT
           END-EXEC.
           CALL 'TAXCALC' USING BY REFERENCE WS-GROSS-PAY WS-TAX-DUE.
           SUBTRACT WS-TAX-DUE FROM WS-GROSS-PAY GIVING WS-NET-PAY.
           PERFORM 1200-READ-NEXT-EMP.

       2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       3000-SUMMARY-REPORT.
           DISPLAY 'PAYROLL BATCH COMPLETED'.

       4000-TERMINATE-PROGRAM.
           CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE PAYROLL-REPORT.